# Saya Lune

![Saya color and costume sheet](./data/header.png)

Saya carries the emotional center of the story. The costume avoids armor and favors wrapped cloth to show movement in wind scenes.

## Design Notes

- Dominant shape: crescent curves
- Palette: pale mint, moon gray, wine red
- Symbol: thread bracelet from chapter zero

Her hair arc is used as a directional line in compositions.
